    },
    {
      "id": "TextureMagnificationFilter",
      "field": "properties/LINEAR/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:61187b09b82abd0bb737067e8bb6ebaa6c2cd133fa1b0f51e3b76d0f122831cf",
      "text": "对最近四个纹素进行双线性插值采样，比 <code>NEAREST</code> 过滤更平滑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "TextureMagnificationFilter",
      "field": "properties/NEAREST/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ed390af38d16b99f12e83f5384c79d77752216c0148069d2a2b4f46fe11228b3",
      "text": "返回最近纹素的值进行纹理采样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "TextureMinificationFilter.LINEAR_MIPMAP_LINEAR",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1c33340025222500794d35d4c2bb00593b3875fbc5a37f5b7fded1260ab3deef",
      "text": "在相邻两个 mip 层级内分别线性采样，再对结果线性插值。\n<p>\n采样具有 mipmap 的纹理时，在画质和速度之间取得较好平衡。\n</p>\n<p>\n要求纹理具有 mipmap。mip 层级根据观察角度及纹理在屏幕空间的尺寸选择。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "TextureMinificationFilter.LINEAR_MIPMAP_NEAREST",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5da2369172a03e8d287c7da505451dbde45ebb51f8ce58775fa92d05d33f3ebd",
      "text": "选择最近的 mip 层级，并在该层级内线性采样。\n<p>\n要求纹理具有 mipmap。mip 层级根据观察角度及纹理在屏幕空间的尺寸选择。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "TextureMinificationFilter.LINEAR",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:61187b09b82abd0bb737067e8bb6ebaa6c2cd133fa1b0f51e3b76d0f122831cf",
      "text": "对最近四个纹素进行双线性插值采样，比 <code>NEAREST</code> 过滤更平滑。"
    },
    {
